    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hesekiya ghwayam ng'asheega diini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea niduulean ng'asheesu, fuga sean bea Israeli eawoojisu mida hoowa gwarita gaweay jeeda mujiinajeega Yuda ak gwahiirjeawi daranajeega ak gwalalaksa ng'eanyi sanaamajeega siguura Asherimu ak gwanyarjeawi heetiyeada ea heeda wagiida aba ng'eanyoojiga sean bea Yuda, ea Benjamini, ea Efraimu, ea Manase, bwak ea gwanyarjeawi sean. Hean gabiikta jeeda mujiinajeega nyaawa fuga sean bea Israeli, gaba siisi weah gheanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwalakiisa Hesekiya gadiyeeda ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi, gaba siisi bea gadiyeadaanyi, nea ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi gayghoah haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida, ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea hoyyoo, nea gagadiiy aba gidaghuusiga maheemajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gabadiischeesa nea gwaduumsheesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gujaweeda sugoocheanda bea jeeda meanang'oocheanduumeadaanyi gaba haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida; haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida bea sakteayda ea shing'ada, ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida bea sabaato, ea sheega eeshish, ea ghweelmajeega siloat gawuurji gising'oarda aba jeeda deaweedeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwarukusa fuga abiita Yerusalemu gideaba gayghoadayda gida miisa ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi, ak abeeda gagadiiy muuchi aba gidanyaashta deaweedeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwarita diigheanda, fuga Israeli ghoadayda aba seang'ayda haghweega madeeda bea booga, ea difaayi, ea nagheeda, ea maleeda, ea booga madeeda bea madamnyeanda; ak gweadu aba seang'ayda gideaba damanamughuush bea haleanjeeda sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga Israeli ea gea Yuda abiita jeeda mujiinajeega Yuda eara saawa gweadu gideaba damanamughuush bea dugwa ea gisilga, ea haleanjeeda siikghaydiit ghayi siikghaydiisa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa, ak gawiilsa ng'eanyi nea ghwanung' gabadiina gharmucheeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda sheedeaba samwagu ghoang'eat ghabwada geat gharmucheeka, ak ghoahiita aba jeeda sheedeaba ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghapka Hesekiya sea fugaaschi hees ak ghwadaah gharmucheeka, hean gabadiischeesa NG'UTAMIIDA ea fugaaschi was Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobearsa Hesekiya ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi iiteaba gharmucheekiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwasha ghuuta Asariya was ashoohoocheanda haw, bea gheeh Sadoki, ak gwayeesha, “Damanda ang'eat gweadu buuneeda gujaweeda jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, geeyeagiischi ea eelang'uuda ea eapuuda gea saang'a; aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA niidaw ghawooda fugaaschi, hean ghoah haleanjeeda saang'a siipuudiini.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwarukuta Hesekiya gideaba gajeesin gealga aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA; ng'ata hean ghwadeas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gweadu gah aba doobiiwnata gujaweeda ea gideaba damanamughuush ea haleanjeeda siikghaydiit. Nea siida haw miineadaysa saawa geeguura Gonaniya was siida Lawi, ea Shimeyi was orjeeda geanyaawa bassa niny aba hawunda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea Yahieli, ea Asasiya, ea Nahati, ea Asaheli, ea Yeremoti, ea Yosabadi, ea Elieli, ea Ismakiya, ea Mahati, ea Benaya ea fuga miineadaysa buuneeda gil nea gwanda hiing'eadayda Gonaniya ea Shimeyi was orjeeda ghaamwat, nea ghaghwal sugoocheanda was Hesekiya ea Asariya was siida miineadaysa gheeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Gore was orjeeda Imna was siida Lawi, was furiischoocheanda gidaghuuta heeda ghayeawa, gamiineadaysa haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea hayapta bea ASEETA, ghwalajaada gujaweeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA ea haleanjeeda ghaydidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea hing'eadaydaanyi gwanda Edeni, ea Miniamini, ea Yeshuwa, ea Shemaya, ea Amariya, ea Shekaniya nea inyeesa gaweechi niny aba doobiiwnata aba jeeda mujiinajeega ashoohoodiga, gwalakiisa orjooga geanyaawa aba galanda nea geanung' gooyang'deay fuga hees ea gea manang'i, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "geaghus giikeanji sing'waar aba gheawungean, headiga bea gweanyeew samwagu ea ghwanaawda, gea wadiini jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA gawuurji gidaweeda gadiyeeda aba gilinyoo ea askwearjeanda gil, aba giduurji galanyoojiga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ng'oorda gheawunga ashoohoodiga ghabeada gidawadiiniida gealga ghweaniga nyaawa, nea fuga Lawi bea gweanyeew diktam ea ghwanaawda gawuurji gidawadiiniida gadiyoojiga nyaawa, aba giduurji galanda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ashoohoodiga geeyiiluudayi sea diibiga nyaawa manang'i, ea gadeemga nyaawa, ea orjooga nyaawa, ea haweega nyaawa, aba jeeda eemeetuw; aba gideaba ea doobiiweadi aba giighaydidandeaba geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea orjooga Haruni, was ashoohoodiga, mida jeeda madameega bea ng'eanyiida bea mujiinajeega nyaawa, gwanda headiga siguush aba gheawunga nyaawa aba jeeda mujiinajeega jea gwalakiisa headiga aba jeeda ashoohoodiga ea jeeda fuga Lawi was gea goola eeyiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasindunu Hesekiya aba jeeda ng'eanyiida sean bea Yuda; hean gwasin doobiiwnata ea alooheeda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gadiyoojiga sean ang'eat bea gadiyeesiinda gheeda ASEETA aba gidaweeda deaweeda ea diigheanyeeka, aba gaseadayda ASEATAANYI, gwasin aba gurooroadaanyi sean, ak ghwanyagaada.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
